What is the Asia-Pacific Dental Market?
Dental products are essential tools and materials used for the diagnosis, prevention, and treatment of oral diseases and the maintenance of healthy teeth. This market is broadly categorized into two segments: dental consumables, which are single-use or patient-specific products like implants, crowns, orthodontics, and biomaterials; and dental equipment, which includes durable devices such as chairs, imaging systems (X-rays), and handpieces used for procedures.
